cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this work, use the metadata below."
type: software
title: "warp-drive: Warp Engine — a computable feasibility audit of an Alcubierre warp drive"
abstract: >-
  A flat-slice 3+1 ADM solver for Alcubierre-type warp metrics, validated
  point-by-point against Alcubierre's 1994 closed-form energy density, plus a
  design-space sweep over payload radius, vehicle envelope and cruise speed that
  reports the cheapest admissible warp bubble and the wall thickness the quantum
  inequality forces. Every number in the documents is reproducible from
  scripts/audit.py.
authors:
  - name: "zdltvxq"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
url: "https://github.com/zdltvxq/warp-drive"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zdltvxq/warp-drive"
license: MIT
